This is the cbs33m-write-a-block package meant as a guide to building
out-of-tree packages. To use the cbs33m blocks, the Python namespaces
is in 'cbs33m', which is imported as:

    import cbs33m

See the Doxygen documentation for details about the blocks available
in this package. A quick listing of the details can be found in Python
after importing by using:

    help(cbs33m)
